 * Engineering **experimental effects** (special effects) — the stat modifiers each
 * experimental applies, resolved to journal Modifier Labels. Keyed by the effect's
 * Frontier `fdname` (as it appears in `Engineering.ExperimentalEffect`).
 *
 * Source:  EDSY (github.com/taleden/EDSY) eddb.js `expeffect` — coriolis-data does
 *          not carry the numeric experimental modifiers. EDSY is (c) taleden under a
 *          CC BY-NC 4.0 License (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/).
 *          The game logic is Elite Dangerous data, property of Frontier Developments
 *          plc, under Frontier's media-usage terms:
 *          https://forums.frontier.co.uk/threads/510879/
 *
 * Each effect is a list of contributions { label, method, value }, applied on top of
 * a blueprint. Weapon-combat-only effects are dropped, matching the stats layer.
 *
 * Full provenance: data/ships/SOURCES.md.
 */
